3031
03:01:17.106 --> 03:01:20.186
We are asking for rights consistency and consultation

3032
03:01:20.206 --> 03:01:23.806
requirements to be built into the primary legislation

3033
03:01:23.846 --> 03:01:25.946
itself so that protections

3034
